- Place choice: ask_binary_choice("בחוץ|i_me+want+🌳||בחוץ", "להישאר בפנים|i_me+want+🏠||בפנים")

Don't use this for open-ended questions — use rebuild_board() with multiple SENTENCE BUTTONs for those.
